     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Colleagues,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I wish to alert you to a new paper that provides a simulation-based comparison of various landmark-based and various surface-based approaches for shape quantification and analysis. Here we generated samples of 3D surface meshes that differed\r\n by known amounts, quantified their shape through various methods, and compared the inferred patterns from those methods to the actual (simulated truth) shape patterns.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11692-026-09674-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11692-026-09674-1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483119503000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TStCGERY9AuzzVhQw256x\">https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11692-026-09674-1</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nWe hope this helps empiricists in making decisions regarding their digitization methodology.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nBest, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dean<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Dr. Dean C. Adams</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Distinguished Professor</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Director, Ecology and Evolutionary Biology Graduate Program</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Iowa State University</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483119503000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oto7oOmfZ2OzKX4iC--w7\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></a></span></u><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
